@startuml 事件触发机制详细时序图

!theme plain
skinparam sequenceMessageAlign center
skinparam maxMessageSize 60
skinparam ParticipantPadding 20

title 事件触发机制完整时序图

participant "发布者" as Publisher
participant "WorkflowEventBus" as EventBus
participant "DelayQueue" as Queue
participant "WorkflowEventBusFireWorker" as FireWorker
participant "ScheduledExecutorService" as Scheduler
participant "eventHandlerMap" as HandlerMap
participant "EventHandler" as Handler
participant "StateActionFactory" as StateFactory
participant "StateAction" as Action
participant "Database" as DB

== 阶段1: 系统启动 - Handler注册 ==

note over Scheduler, HandlerMap: **系统启动时，注册所有事件处理器**

Scheduler -> FireWorker: 创建 WorkflowEventBusFireWorker
activate FireWorker

Scheduler -> FireWorker: 注入所有 ILifecycleEventHandler\n(Spring 自动注入)
activate FireWorker
FireWorker -> HandlerMap: registerEventHandler(handler)
activate HandlerMap
note right of HandlerMap: 注册 Handler 到 Map\nkey: eventType\nvalue: handler
HandlerMap -> HandlerMap: eventHandlerMap.put(eventType, handler)
HandlerMap --> FireWorker: 注册成功
deactivate HandlerMap
deactivate FireWorker

Scheduler -> Scheduler: scheduleWithFixedDelay(\n  worker::fireAllRegisteredEvent,\n  100ms, 100ms\n)
note right of Scheduler: **每100ms执行一次轮询**

== 阶段2: 事件发布 ==

note over Publisher, Queue: **内部事件：Master 内部发布**

group 场景1: 工作流启动事件

    Publisher -> EventBus: publish(WorkflowStartLifecycleEvent)
    activate EventBus
    
    EventBus -> EventBus: workflowEventBusSummary.increaseEventCount()
    EventBus -> Queue: delayEventQueue.add(event)
    activate Queue
    note right of Queue: **事件放入延迟队列\n支持延迟执行**
    Queue --> EventBus: 事件已入队
    deactivate Queue
    
    EventBus -> EventBus: log.info("Publish event: {}", event)
    EventBus --> Publisher: 立即返回（异步）
    deactivate EventBus
    
end

group 场景2: 任务启动事件

    Publisher -> EventBus: publish(TaskStartLifecycleEvent)
    activate EventBus
    EventBus -> Queue: delayEventQueue.add(event)
    activate Queue
    Queue --> EventBus: 事件已入队
    deactivate Queue
    EventBus --> Publisher: 立即返回
    deactivate EventBus
    
end

group 场景3: Worker 回调事件（外部事件）

    note over Publisher: **Worker 通过 RPC 回调 Master**
    
    Publisher -> Publisher: TaskExecutorEventListenerImpl\n.onTaskExecutorSuccess(event)
    activate Publisher
    
    Publisher -> Publisher: getTaskExecutionRunnable(event)
    Publisher -> Publisher: 构建 TaskSuccessLifecycleEvent
    
    Publisher -> EventBus: publish(TaskSuccessLifecycleEvent)
    activate EventBus
    EventBus -> Queue: delayEventQueue.add(event)
    activate Queue
    Queue --> EventBus: 事件已入队
    deactivate Queue
    EventBus --> Publisher: 立即返回
    deactivate EventBus
    deactivate Publisher
    
end

== 阶段3: 事件轮询 ==

note over Scheduler, FireWorker: **每100ms执行一次轮询**

loop 每100ms执行一次
    Scheduler -> FireWorker: fireAllRegisteredEvent()
    activate FireWorker
    
    FireWorker -> FireWorker: getWaitingFireWorkflowExecutionRunnables()
    note right of FireWorker: 获取所有有事件的工作流\n过滤条件：!eventBus.isEmpty()
    
    alt 有事件需要处理
        loop 遍历每个工作流
            FireWorker -> FireWorker: doFireSingleWorkflowEventBus(workflow)
            activate FireWorker
            
            FireWorker -> EventBus: isEmpty()?
            activate EventBus
            EventBus --> FireWorker: false (有事件)
            deactivate EventBus
            
            == 阶段4: 从队列取出事件 ==
            
            loop 处理该工作流的所有事件
                FireWorker -> EventBus: poll()
                activate EventBus
                EventBus -> Queue: delayEventQueue.poll()
                activate Queue
                
                alt 队列中有事件
                    Queue --> EventBus: Optional<AbstractLifecycleEvent>
                    EventBus --> FireWorker: 事件对象
                    deactivate Queue
                    deactivate EventBus
                    
                    == 阶段5: 事件分发 ==
                    
                    FireWorker -> FireWorker: doFireSingleEvent(workflow, event)
                    activate FireWorker
                    
                    FireWorker -> FireWorker: event.getEventType()
                    FireWorker -> HandlerMap: get(eventType)
                    activate HandlerMap
                    note right of HandlerMap: **根据事件类型获取 Handler**
                    HandlerMap --> FireWorker: ILifecycleEventHandler
                    deactivate HandlerMap
                    
                    alt Handler 不存在
                        FireWorker -> FireWorker: throw RuntimeException\n("No EventHandler found")
                    else Handler 存在
                        FireWorker -> Handler: handle(workflowRunnable, event)
                        activate Handler
                        
                        == 阶段6: Handler 处理 ==
                        
                        Handler -> Handler: 根据事件类型处理
                        
                        alt 工作流事件
                            Handler -> StateFactory: getAction(workflowRunnable.getState())
                            activate StateFactory
                            note right of StateFactory: **根据当前状态选择 StateAction**
                            StateFactory --> Handler: IWorkflowStateAction
                            deactivate StateFactory
                            
                            Handler -> Action: 调用对应的 action 方法
                            activate Action
                            
                            Action -> Action: 执行业务逻辑
                            Action -> DB: 更新数据库（如果需要）
                            activate DB
                            DB --> Action: 更新成功
                            deactivate DB
                            
                            Action -> Action: 可能发布新事件
                            Action -> EventBus: publish(newEvent)
                            activate EventBus
                            EventBus -> Queue: delayEventQueue.add(newEvent)
                            activate Queue
                            Queue --> EventBus: 新事件已入队
                            deactivate Queue
                            EventBus --> Action: 立即返回
                            deactivate EventBus
                            
                            Action --> Handler: 处理完成
                            deactivate Action
                            
                        else 任务事件
                            Handler -> Handler: 获取 TaskExecutionRunnable
                            Handler -> StateFactory: getTaskStateAction(taskState)
                            activate StateFactory
                            StateFactory --> Handler: ITaskStateAction
                            deactivate StateFactory
                            
                            Handler -> Action: 调用对应的 action 方法
                            activate Action
                            
                            Action -> Action: 执行业务逻辑
                            Action -> DB: 更新任务状态
                            activate DB
                            DB --> Action: 更新成功
                            deactivate DB
                            
                            Action -> Action: 可能发布新事件
                            Action -> EventBus: publish(newEvent)
                            activate EventBus
                            EventBus -> Queue: delayEventQueue.add(newEvent)
                            activate Queue
                            Queue --> EventBus: 新事件已入队
                            deactivate Queue
                            EventBus --> Action: 立即返回
                            deactivate EventBus
                            
                            Action --> Handler: 处理完成
                            deactivate Action
                        end
                        
                        Handler --> FireWorker: 处理完成
                        deactivate Handler
                        
                        FireWorker -> EventBus: increaseFireSuccessEventCount()
                        activate EventBus
                        EventBus --> FireWorker: 计数已增加
                        deactivate EventBus
                    end
                    
                    FireWorker --> FireWorker: 继续处理下一个事件
                    deactivate FireWorker
                    
                else 队列为空
                    Queue --> EventBus: Optional.empty()
                    EventBus --> FireWorker: 没有事件
                    deactivate Queue
                    deactivate EventBus
                    break
                end
            end
            
            FireWorker --> FireWorker: 处理下一个工作流
            deactivate FireWorker
        end
    else 没有事件
        FireWorker -> FireWorker: return (直接返回)
    end
    
    FireWorker --> Scheduler: 本轮轮询完成
    deactivate FireWorker
end

== 阶段7: 异常处理 ==

note over FireWorker, Queue: **事件处理异常时的处理**

FireWorker -> Handler: handle(workflow, event)
activate Handler
Handler -> Action: 执行业务逻辑
activate Action
Action -> DB: updateById(...)
activate DB
DB --> Action: **异常：数据库连接失败**
deactivate DB
Action --> Handler: 抛出异常
deactivate Action
Handler --> FireWorker: 异常传播
deactivate Handler

FireWorker -> FireWorker: catch Exception
FireWorker -> FireWorker: ExceptionUtils.isDatabaseConnectedFailedException(ex)?

alt 数据库连接失败
    FireWorker -> EventBus: publish(event)
    activate EventBus
    note right of EventBus: **重新发布事件，等待重试**
    EventBus -> Queue: delayEventQueue.add(event)
    activate Queue
    Queue --> EventBus: 事件已重新入队
    deactivate Queue
    EventBus --> FireWorker: 重新发布成功
    deactivate EventBus
    
    FireWorker -> FireWorker: ThreadUtils.sleep(5_000)
    note right of FireWorker: **等待5秒后重试**
else 其他异常
    FireWorker -> EventBus: decreaseFireSuccessEventCount()
    activate EventBus
    EventBus --> FireWorker: 计数已减少
    deactivate EventBus
    
    FireWorker -> EventBus: increaseFireFailedEventCount()
    activate EventBus
    EventBus --> FireWorker: 计数已增加
    deactivate EventBus
    
    FireWorker -> FireWorker: throw WorkflowEventFireException
end

== 阶段8: 事件链式触发示例 ==

note over Publisher, Action: **事件可以触发新事件，形成事件链**

group 工作流启动 → 任务启动 → 任务分发 → Worker执行 → 任务完成 → 触发后续任务

    Publisher -> EventBus: publish(WorkflowStartLifecycleEvent)
    activate EventBus
    EventBus -> Queue: add(event1)
    EventBus --> Publisher: 返回
    deactivate EventBus
    
    note over FireWorker: 100ms后轮询
    
    FireWorker -> Queue: poll() → event1
    FireWorker -> Handler: handle(event1)
    Handler -> Action: WorkflowRunningStateAction.startEventAction()
    Action -> EventBus: publish(TaskStartLifecycleEvent)  ← **触发新事件**
    activate EventBus
    EventBus -> Queue: add(event2)
    EventBus --> Action: 返回
    deactivate EventBus
    
    note over FireWorker: 继续处理队列中的事件
    
    FireWorker -> Queue: poll() → event2
    FireWorker -> Handler: handle(event2)
    Handler -> Action: TaskSubmittedStateAction.startEventAction()
    Action -> EventBus: publish(TaskDispatchLifecycleEvent)  ← **触发新事件**
    activate EventBus
    EventBus -> Queue: add(event3)
    EventBus --> Action: 返回
    deactivate EventBus
    
    note over FireWorker: 继续处理...
    
    FireWorker -> Queue: poll() → event3
    FireWorker -> Handler: handle(event3)
    Handler -> Action: TaskSubmittedStateAction.dispatchEventAction()
    Action -> Action: 任务入队，等待分发到 Worker
    
    note over Publisher: Worker 执行任务后回调
    
    Publisher -> EventBus: publish(TaskSuccessLifecycleEvent)  ← **Worker回调触发**
    activate EventBus
    EventBus -> Queue: add(event4)
    EventBus --> Publisher: 返回
    deactivate EventBus
    
    note over FireWorker: 继续处理...
    
    FireWorker -> Queue: poll() → event4
    FireWorker -> Handler: handle(event4)
    Handler -> Action: TaskRunningStateAction.succeedEventAction()
    Action -> EventBus: publish(WorkflowTopologyLogicalTransitionEvent)  ← **触发新事件**
    activate EventBus
    EventBus -> Queue: add(event5)
    EventBus --> Action: 返回
    deactivate EventBus
    
    note over FireWorker: 继续处理...
    
    FireWorker -> Queue: poll() → event5
    FireWorker -> Handler: handle(event5)
    Handler -> Action: WorkflowRunningStateAction.topologyLogicalTransitionEventAction()
    Action -> Action: triggerTasks() 触发后续任务
    Action -> EventBus: publish(TaskStartLifecycleEvent)  ← **触发后续任务**
    activate EventBus
    EventBus -> Queue: add(event6)
    EventBus --> Action: 返回
    deactivate EventBus
    
    note over FireWorker: **事件链式触发，形成完整的执行流程**
    
end

== 总结 ==

note over Publisher, DB
  **事件触发机制的关键点：**
  
  1. **异步发布**：publish() 立即返回，事件放入队列
  2. **定时轮询**：每100ms轮询一次，处理队列中的事件
  3. **类型映射**：根据事件类型从 eventHandlerMap 获取 Handler
  4. **状态选择**：Handler 根据当前状态选择 StateAction
  5. **链式触发**：事件处理可能发布新事件，形成事件链
  6. **异常重试**：数据库连接失败时，事件重新入队等待重试
  7. **多线程处理**：多个 Worker 并行处理不同工作流的事件
  
  **事件来源：**
  - 内部事件：Master 内部组件发布
  - 外部事件：Worker 通过 RPC 回调发布
end note

@enduml
